WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
Or make up lies

2
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:02,920
You know the outcome

3
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:05,100
Qin Ya and I both drank too much on the night of the university graduation party.

4
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:07,700
How did that child get to you? I went back to the store two months ago

5
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:08,940
Saw a man sitting in front of the store

6
00:00:08,940 --> 00:00:10,100
There is also a military bag next to it

7
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:11,660
I brought her into the store and she told me

8
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:12,700
My mother’s name is Qin Ya

9
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:13,620
Dad's name is Lin Yu

10
00:00:13,620 --> 00:00:14,780
She has been abroad

11
00:00:14,780 --> 00:00:16,420
Even I didn’t know until my children came to the door.

12
00:00:17,310 --> 00:00:20,870
Have you slept with that girl from the Xu family for more than half a year since your marriage?

13
00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:21,790
Have you ever kissed?

14
00:00:22,470 --> 00:00:24,670
Does kissing once on the face count when you get married?

15
00:00:25,230 --> 00:00:27,550
I'll give you one more chance to answer. Tell me honestly.

16
00:00:27,550 --> 00:00:28,830
Have you ever kissed me?

17
00:00:28,870 --> 00:00:30,550
I asked you before when you were going to have a baby.

18
00:00:30,550 --> 00:00:32,870
Didn't you say that you had already started building it? I didn't say that.

19
00:00:32,870 --> 00:00:33,910
You are not allowed to kill me

20
00:00:33,910 --> 00:00:36,070
How can I have something like you that doesn't bleed?

21
00:00:36,070 --> 00:00:37,190
A man can do your job

22
00:00:37,190 --> 00:00:38,310
What a failure

23
00:00:38,310 --> 00:00:41,230
It’s embarrassing to not even have a kiss on the lips after being married for half a year

24
00:00:41,230 --> 00:00:42,150
No matter what happens to them in the future
